@startuml Decompiler Flow

title Decompilation and Syntax Highlighting Flow

skinparam activityBackgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333

|User|
start
:Open .class or .jar file;

|gui|
:Load bytecode with ASM 9.6;

if (Single class?) then (yes)
    :Decompile with JD-Core;
else (jar/Save All Sources)
    :Decompile with Vineflower;
endif

:Get Java source code;

|Language Provider|
:Lookup LanguageSyntaxProvider\nby file extension (.java);

:Get TokenMaker class name;

|RSyntaxTextArea|
:Register TokenMaker;
:Apply syntax highlighting;

|ANTLR Parser|
:Parse source with\nJava grammar (latest/8/9/20);

:Extract declarations\n(classes, methods, fields);

:Extract references\n(type usage, method calls);

|gui|
:Build navigation index;
:Enable hyperlink navigation;
:Display in editor;

|User|
:Browse decompiled source;
:Click to navigate;

stop

note right
  **Supported Java Versions**
  - Java 8: Basic features
  - Java 9: Modules
  - Java 20: Records, Patterns
  - Latest: Java 24+ features
end note

@enduml
